%% RECONSTRUCTED from discussions 2026-10-17 through 2026-10-22; TARGET not verified runtime
flowchart TD
  Start["Owner 授權工作包"] --> PM["PM AI 分派任務"]
  PM --> Developer["Developer 執行、測試、自審"]
  Developer --> Result{"工作包回報"}
  Result -->|PASS| Reviewer["獨立 Reviewer 審查"]
  Result -->|FAIL| PM
  Result -->|BLOCKED| PM
  Reviewer --> Check{"審查結果"}
  Check -->|需要修復| PM
  Check -->|通過| Integrator["Integrator 驗收 / GitHub PR"]
  Integrator --> Gate{"驗收與授權條件"}
  Gate -->|通過| Finish["記錄證據、合併或完成工作包"]
  Gate -->|未通過| PM
  PM --> Decision{"需要 Owner 重大決策？"}
  Decision -->|否| Developer
  Decision -->|是| Owner["向 Owner 回報與請示"]
  Owner --> PM
  Finish --> PM
